covalence (0.5.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Headphones: AirPods Pro 3 (A3063, A3064, A3065) recognised, with noise
    control, adaptive audio, conversation awareness and one-bud noise
    cancellation. A model number Covalence does not know yet keeps every
    control instead of leaving only ear detection.
