covalence (0.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Recopie becomes a separate app; UxPlay tuned for latency (60 fps,
    hardware decoding: NVIDIA, VA-API or software), rotation, full screen.
  * iPhone control from the PC (experimental, off by default): Bluetooth
    LE mouse and keyboard through AssistiveTouch, with a step-by-step guide.
  * 11 more free sounds (19 in all).
  * Settings: one tab per kind of feature; "experimental" instead of "alpha".
  * About: narrower window, short credits.

