covalence (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Internet through the iPhone (Bluetooth tethering, NetworkManager).
  * Wingpanel indicator: battery, now playing, call, unread messages.
  * Proximity lock (off by default, never unlocks).
  * Message search, pinned conversations, mark as unread.
  * Files with LocalSend, both ways (off by default).
  * iCloud Drive sync status in Files (libcloudproviders); iCloud.com
    shortcuts (Find My, Notes, Hide My Email, Reminders, Photos).
  * Screen mirroring with UxPlay (experimental); photo import over USB.
  * Settings in tabs; Covalence's free sounds with preview and "Use for".

